## Reading: pre-placement settled call amount=34.28 (correct). After group/place the still-mounted CheckoutScreen rebuilds on post-placement state (cart removed/reloaded, per-store tax gone) -> viewTotalPrice 32.65 (= 35.66 - 3.01, no VAT); the 800ms callback now assigns _payableAmount = 32.65 BEFORE showCashBackSnackBar(), so the estimate call carries the transient. Pre-fix the same callback read the stale previous _payableAmount (the last settled client total: 31.88 in the ticket's divergent case; == charged in a divergence-free group basket). Single-store placements (#91416 #91421 #91424) fire NO post-placement call. Snackbar text shows the offer (5%), not calculated_amount, so user-visible text is unchanged unless an offer's min_purchase falls between 32.65 and 34.28.
